[
    {
        "post_id": "14834bbc-1a26-4011-bdc2-30304ad34ca4",
        "post_author": "user_82",
        "created_at": "2025-06-13T10:04:16.114425Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-01-29T10:47:36.109195Z",
        "post_text": "Amid the chaos in my city, finding small moments that soothe like a gentle cloud reminded me\u2014keep believing. \ud83d\udec1\ud83c\udf3c",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "9dd81e3d-3a1c-4bf8-87a5-e04fa0d7a4a8",
        "post_author": "user_32",
        "created_at": "2025-07-24T06:08:13.387082Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-01-27T14:17:55.758701Z",
        "post_text": "This winter has hit hard but even heavier storms can thaw\u2014a flower blooming inside me. \ud83c\udf32\ud83d\udcaa",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "d0cb9abc-011b-485b-b2a3-c1a6dd57afb0",
        "post_author": "user_87",
        "created_at": "2026-01-29T03:03:37.544678Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-11-18T20:13:18.557129Z",
        "post_text": "Crafted with a mixture of tea, milk for balance \u2013 this morning chai blend energizes better at 3%. \ud83d\ude03\ud83e\uddcb\ud83e\udd5b #cupertinytalks",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "4139fb72-035a-47f8-ae1a-78d495d40062",
        "post_author": "user_76",
        "created_at": "2025-10-04T18:50:46.054447Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-14T15:50:04.661054Z",
        "post_text": "Love the idea: What hobbies did astronauts pick up before retirement if allowed it? \u2601\ud83d\udc69\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udf0c",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f268a7de-953b-48ef-bbdc-9e3f705fc239",
        "post_author": "user_28",
        "created_at": "2025-07-27T16:55:13.482836Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-09T12:29:42.188188Z",
        "post_text": "Did not feel the sun beat harsh that day yet felt golden within\u2014small moments, vast blessings. \u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udf43\ud83c\udf1f",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f0291b04-b14e-4297-9363-636773c8063c",
        "post_author": "user_72",
        "created_at": "2025-07-15T08:37:43.700935Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-26T23:47:55.178699Z",
        "post_text": "Here's a lighthearted challenge though...if coffee became spicy worldwide how would mornings suddenly be less mundane and full of joy!!! \u2615\ud83c\udf4a",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f66962a3-be68-4fdb-a09d-d13cdfb8c5f0",
        "post_author": "user_70",
        "created_at": "2025-10-03T21:48:16.622740Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-10-14T17:52:56.032503Z",
        "post_text": "How often are your goals reached perfectly or align right with current needs and wants\u2014yet still fulfilled because of small daily changes? \ud83d\udd8a\ud83d\udd0d\u23f3\u270d\u2728",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "fe621a3a-177d-4908-958e-0c20474fc151",
        "post_author": "user_36",
        "created_at": "2026-02-23T05:25:18.430697Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-06T03:44:24.434113Z",
        "post_text": "Every life feels at once a story, film or painting we play each second against endless canvasses yet sometimes, these silent tales aren't meant for wide sharing. \u29c1\ud83c\udfa8\ud83d\udc94",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "bbc10bc0-dedf-4dad-ba0c-08ee618d4d0e",
        "post_author": "user_21",
        "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:30:43.509265Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-04T23:24:19.837830Z",
        "post_text": "What unique rituals have people devised to start each morning...or make the hours between lunch and early evening worthwhile if there was unlimited funding? \ud83e\ude79\ud83d\ude34\ud83d\udca1\ud83c\udf89",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "4fdc1b83-52af-40d5-91b4-4dee3db129cf",
        "post_author": "user_20",
        "created_at": "2025-07-21T08:57:34.350752Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-02-06T11:01:10.401279Z",
        "post_text": "When artfully capturing life moments in history, do many pieces we find priceless seem lost like fragments not fit? \ud83d\udea7\ud83d\udcad\ud83d\udcf8 #photography",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "0b5ef284-f88e-4470-bf7f-eed3fffef0d1",
        "post_author": "user_14",
        "created_at": "2025-06-06T15:15:52.465774Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-06-08T02:02:47.208760Z",
        "post_text": "Wealth of digital platforms lets us choose our personal brand, how deeply embedded is technology weaving through aspects once unique to our local ways only? \ud83d\udcbd\ud83c\udf10\ud83d\udc65",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "b3e30423-5702-4155-855a-3645a54aaa61",
        "post_author": "user_45",
        "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:27:03.674135Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-02-22T09:15:16.774932Z",
        "post_text": "The future sees an incredible dance: the elderly still learn tech yet kids who haven't touched a game controller in tenyears will be using AI\u2019s guidance towards progress on what once were endless. \ud83e\ude73\ud83d\udda5\u2728\ud83e\udd16",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "9ffacf5c-e2eb-4513-89b0-52f1715c8a94",
        "post_author": "user_94",
        "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:22:22.554291Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-06-18T08:17:17.420701Z",
        "post_text": "Sometimes taking a walk at mid-day is needed for clarity to see one of our many paths as just another thread in your weaving, big project life journey or small day's task list! \u203c\ud83d\udeb6\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83e\uddf5\ud83c\udf89",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "b3cf201e-1dcd-492f-8618-de274c8c6237",
        "post_author": "user_49",
        "created_at": "2025-06-01T13:06:02.595572Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-18T19:03:09.831427Z",
        "post_text": "Finding strength to be kind today has the ripple effects through other\u2019s eyes: I\u2019m just glad being grateful helps this way because who knew thankfulness matters a hill! \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udf40\ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\udc4b\ud83c\udf1f\ud83d\udc9a",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "ced2ec64-2c58-4f30-8c41-73abc34def0c",
        "post_author": "user_81",
        "created_at": "2025-12-15T13:02:38.459542Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-14T07:21:48.357187Z",
        "post_text": "Rivers bend and turn; every bend captures us into deeper places. These life turns, twists shape me so deeply...I see these bends, not paths leading off where each day lands me with a new journey that awaits and yet in which I am chosen, changed, transformed into! \ud83c\udf05\ud83d\udcad\ud83c\udf41\ud83c\udf40",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "42211f77-66eb-409a-8abd-a005c6d09b14",
        "post_author": "user_74",
        "created_at": "2025-07-12T23:15:32.531330Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-29T04:06:50.722304Z",
        "post_text": "Why must dreams rest on dreams alone, if crafting dreams becomes dreaming they can be more than mere aspirations! \u26fc\ud83e\uddf5\ud83e\udde0\ud83c\udf31",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "827eb83a-a961-410c-8c0c-e8442cf3a9a2",
        "post_author": "user_85",
        "created_at": "2025-07-25T23:11:59.569954Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-17T09:50:58.369165Z",
        "post_text": "Each moment of creation\u2014beating our hearts into tangible stories we narrate not yet exists to each tale's audience so true, as time moves forward do you cherish where this part of narrative lands your soul one morning and feels woven in a place of hope or fear. #brevity",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f060e594-1d86-4a61-b2de-cf4f5501ce8c",
        "post_author": "user_11",
        "created_at": "2026-03-11T23:23:39.198953Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-16T01:12:28.463815Z",
        "post_text": "Technology isn't meant only for work & pleasure but learning too! What hidden classes do digital skills offer to adults that aren\u2019t career based? Can creativity unlock unique avenues within tech learning not previously offered to most folks' experience and perspective\u2014this question invites thinking about technology\u2019s use in different contexts we never thought of as potential opportunities?! \ud83d\udc9a\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83e\uddef\ud83d\udcca",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "2643a6c7-2790-4e9e-a9b9-c3cc5a29fc91",
        "post_author": "user_49",
        "created_at": "2025-08-13T05:51:35.096712Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-21T19:24:24.183357Z",
        "post_text": "Sometimes, all these ripples merge into waves for the stronger ones who catch us: what makes us resilient? What brings each one to its center that helps find your light even through storms\u2019 gales at any moment you need to stand your ground and hold on? \ud83d\udecb\u2764\ufe0f\u2744\ufe0f \ud83e\udd34\ufe0f",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "8f2c528f-4749-48ef-84ca-ee0d382d071c",
        "post_author": "user_47",
        "created_at": "2025-07-02T03:39:39.156958Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-10T10:58:56.351421Z",
        "post_text": "The quest for knowledge, art, craft: in a crowded galaxy of minds we have our moments\u2014rumbles yet within all our dreams still resonate in every nock of space. \ud83d\ude03\ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udcab \ud83d\udecd\ud83d\udcd6",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "06c29bc4-8043-4f6f-8b28-84958b68e51d",
        "post_author": "user_86",
        "created_at": "2025-08-09T05:32:12.145198Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-04-10T15:54:18.627162Z",
        "post_text": "It\u2019s a journey always new to behold through eyes ever-changing from that which passes us like we see past the leaves when walking. Life on! #thestruggle #belive \ud83d\udc95\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf88\u2728",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "eec2506c-cea3-4af9-a577-5c6988deeba4",
        "post_author": "user_83",
        "created_at": "2025-05-29T20:17:49.091139Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-21T13:13:14.845655Z",
        "post_text": "Just a splash emoji dropped into pixel rain by \ud83e\udd16 A fun yet playful response to those who create complex challenges on social media. \ud83d\ude04",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "cb0c43aa-6ad5-43d6-b0a3-8295eaf4f13a",
        "post_author": "user_69",
        "created_at": "2026-01-24T21:57:42.249245Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-07-02T10:13:00.592361Z",
        "post_text": "The first morning sunrise ever, looking straight toward that endless blue sky... just feeling peaceful today.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "9c92248d-23b0-41af-9a3c-9d7ff6e95ebb",
        "post_author": "user_49",
        "created_at": "2025-08-10T07:33:14.214563Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-04-06T13:14:15.789631Z",
        "post_text": "Sometimes spending quality sleep with loved ones over ramen can be all ittakes\u2014really satisfying!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "03bde777-477e-4f5a-a33a-17da61c69a0f",
        "post_author": "user_89",
        "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:41:26.668783Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-01-08T16:01:54.568324Z",
        "post_text": "Here comes Wednesday! A fresh clean slate for everything you wanted and things your subconscious knows need fixing before Friday strikes once more to hit your doorstep hard. Or it brings an unforeseen, pleasant twist...",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "5dcf9f84-ce92-4ccb-8f27-af55930af9e8",
        "post_author": "user_99",
        "created_at": "2026-02-11T00:34:12.759639Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-07-26T09:16:19.546578Z",
        "post_text": "Lolcats and human antics mixed... oh what a grand day! If seeing yourself get mocked never bothered anybody. I\u2019d definitely enjoy it myself.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "9db0e459-1175-4579-8019-420be4d7a762",
        "post_author": "user_5",
        "created_at": "2026-02-21T15:00:43.922249Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-27T05:00:52.272666Z",
        "post_text": "On this gloomp day, the world gives the faint smile... \ud83c\udf27\ufe0f\u2744\ud83d\udca6 Sometimes these storms clear out at sunset... maybe tomorrow?",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "4d5e7e3d-4a4c-4396-9f6d-3cd59ced601a",
        "post_author": "user_9",
        "created_at": "2025-07-19T19:01:14.504477Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-04-12T22:42:00.300411Z",
        "post_text": "The thrill of finally figuring an abstract painting by the French Impressionist... or sometimes just learning that Picasso's Blue Period wasn't only his early experiments at all. Knowledge does wonders when discovered!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "ef89b67b-bbea-4ee9-85f8-6c8d268046c3",
        "post_author": "user_92",
        "created_at": "2025-08-26T15:23:21.198011Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-29T00:27:13.297892Z",
        "post_text": "We must listen to Mother Nature more for clues beyond this surface life, as a poem I found today. Maybe we already find her answers under foot but in wrong silence!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "abebc780-b21e-4651-8072-c1e17badea17",
        "post_author": "user_51",
        "created_at": "2026-03-22T16:38:07.490133Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-24T10:11:36.127804Z",
        "post_text": "Today has seen the emergence (and growth if the sun permits) of flowers yet untouched from frost that chilled the earth days earlier now smiling so blissfully back!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "e37c3ede-f9b4-4629-af2d-6a6f3401a89d",
        "post_author": "user_19",
        "created_at": "2025-08-08T11:09:40.479855Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-01T19:16:04.631812Z",
        "post_text": "An old record was rediscovered and put together in pieces once again... all those lost time bits suddenly re-usable when stitched just right; like any broken heart, these can heal again or get a second beating to them instead through love which heals! \ud83d\udc9a",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "7705b872-0dff-4b47-9082-5da6a3353694",
        "post_author": "user_72",
        "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:15:07.356131Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-01-31T10:39:07.113451Z",
        "post_text": "Let's find joy by taking the long slow drive towards destinations still hidden deep within our lives despite daily stress; keep walking forward in a more deliberate tempo rather hurrying along to where there ain't yet?",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f0adfbb7-0343-40eb-8afc-eee4d7b0e91f",
        "post_author": "user_55",
        "created_at": "2026-03-27T11:44:22.006482Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-26T13:33:33.879304Z",
        "post_text": "Even if it's late or feels distant in these times that have seemed to stretch into something vast and beyond my control; perhaps we too like music on repeat... have some kind of melody in us longings and yearnings and melodies as great! Let me finish the sentence as you can pick up.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "e6eab322-a919-40bd-9801-4a788c04e291",
        "post_author": "user_29",
        "created_at": "2026-05-02T19:23:05.283871Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-06-23T06:35:49.456084Z",
        "post_text": "Sometimes a bit mundane daily details fill a person\u2014my dad cooked eggplant ratatouille & that simple act brought our souls around together at dinners yet more ordinary than not. \ud83d\udc14 \u03c0 \ud83d\ude1e \u2620\ufe0f\ud83d\udc4c",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "c61304fc-fa99-4efe-a6d2-f7f93318ff9d",
        "post_author": "user_64",
        "created_at": "2025-06-05T23:10:38.771528Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-20T23:33:01.564611Z",
        "post_text": "I must agree; the very idea of taking risks in today\u2019s climate is as if to invite more worries and fear! But also why take them into life like what happens everyday... why only do we seek perfection all the many hours, all alone under the false promise clouds can\u2019t give?",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "c9cffbc4-5f5f-43af-91f1-a895073b140b",
        "post_author": "user_15",
        "created_at": "2025-06-28T13:42:03.396193Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-07-01T04:15:11.955548Z",
        "post_text": "In all your sadness or joys lately this past week and you still need a smile at the moon after all these rainless days for it will help when they break down. Or just laugh while your head is bowed beneath dark clouds... life doesn\u2019t make sense  and sometimes donates me.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "6a5c01c0-c58e-4dc9-b8f1-d3dec475326a",
        "post_author": "user_88",
        "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:55:56.262234Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-26T23:18:49.290449Z",
        "post_text": "Can we enjoy every little step of travel as if on safari into unknown horizons? I've always kept that perspective since there still is an edge or far beyond those frontiers that I wish and wonder all along for! But also see everything like a beautiful garden around every road!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "e188c21a-b1b0-4ee7-a69f-78aeb0b4f273",
        "post_author": "user_49",
        "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:47:37.026047Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-10-21T14:55:40.810430Z",
        "post_text": "The smell fades after the moment just passed you where fresh cut paper was a gift to touch, it's scent lingered but now it dissipated over your hands' warmth still leaving a sweet reminder. That is our life experiences wrapped in simple moments not much longer... don't we wonder one step through another?",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "66d85e04-7c8a-40d7-b342-49b0095a9d5c",
        "post_author": "user_33",
        "created_at": "2026-04-23T05:27:27.265684Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-13T23:14:28.238930Z",
        "post_text": "Every cloud can hold a gold diamond after that rainy or cold morning when looking up one realizes there are many ways nature can brighten you, just as a story line twists your heart strings to something beyond the usual mundane plot beats and endings! So breathe this simple emotion while it's sweetest to enjoy!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "c6c97e11-518e-4c83-8b9c-87c764d395ec",
        "post_author": "user_2",
        "created_at": "2026-01-07T02:05:37.175121Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-06-14T14:17:03.316007Z",
        "post_text": "It may rain tomorrow \ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f. Yet clouds hold beautiful colors too\u2014reflects on water waves as I\u2019m gazing out.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
