        "created_at": "2025-06-13T12:00:28.895812Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-10-09T11:21:16.494395Z",
        "post_text": "Sometimes letting clouds play it\u2019s own symphons of thunderous noises & lighting displays as one walks by gives the space an atmosphere with something magical\u2014let us try seeing and hearing, what do we miss out without such sounds?",
        "likes": 0,
