        "modified_at": "2025-06-11T14:58:11.257074Z",
        "post_text": "The next wave is always there but not every beach may offer a gift in silver moonbeams... what do we gather at the shore after that first morning's dance under cloudless moonlight?! Embers shine in darkness.",
        "likes": 0,
