        "post_author": "user_63",
        "created_at": "2026-02-25T15:10:28.869267Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-04-25T17:57:18.542021Z",
        "post_text": "Art galleries in your local urban core often host rotating, temporary exhibitions showing cutting-edge modern digital tech art. Why spend only the price of a ticket once every few years at these cutting-edge places compared?",
