        "post_author": "user_67",
        "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:49:46.504393Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-02T06:27:50.982055Z",
        "post_text": "Every Sunday morning find yourself doing yoga with a view? Then grab a seat closer behind that tree on your right where those beautiful clouds create such striking colors and play off the greens and yellows across nature at early dawns. Bliss found there is more to discover beyond one spot or usual.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
