        "post_author": "user_30",
        "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:32:46.997549Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-06T09:48:09.847740Z",
        "post_text": "For something entirely practical \u2013 a hack idea: Instead of rushing to park or spending the next 40 min hating its proximity and traffic you just stay for few mins extra when walking home on regular journey. Explore parks at edge often hidden giving short pleasure too while adding little change doesn\u2019t seem noticeable but impact quite high in daily life overall feels.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "noise"
    },
    {
