        "created_at": "2025-05-22T05:58:24.647735Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-05-03T12:32:03.011711Z",
        "post_text": "In my recent experience I discovered: Sometimes we are called towards a cat instead of an empty chair at social gathering. \ud83d\ude3c There\u2019s joy too for me in this space when others look to be seen and understood too via their little buddy \u2013 a friendly purr,",
