        "post_author": "user_45",
        "created_at": "2026-03-21T07:12:36.164378Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-20T17:14:49.950010Z",
        "post_text": "NASA recently celebrated another space anniversary, just this last January astronauts Mark Usenet Kelly and Nick Hague set a new spacewalk mark breaching the ISS \ud83d\udef0 Guinness World Records.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
