        "post_author": "user_48",
        "created_at": "2025-08-15T19:19:45.952481Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-10-10T17:20:12.277458Z",
        "post_text": "With each lunar mission or satellite discovery of exoplanetiics and beyond from Elon's private spaces to JPL-led astronomy missions SpaceX continues to take mankind into unknown territories \ud83c\udf00astronaut",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "df2f7f95-5d01-463b-a13d-43ce723e0d94",
        "post_author": "user_70",
        "created_at": "2026-01-15T13:50:58.660700Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-13T01:08:13.603090Z",
        "post_text": "Today we're honoring astronaut Anne Frank, remembering her words through the stars with astronauts reaching even deeper realms where light years apart \ud83d\udcb0Moon, asteroids. What new frontiers our world travels this century to?\ud83d\udd2d\ud83c\udf0d\u2b50ESA astronauts make a move towards Lunar Excursions in February.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "6bff6c4e-cf17-4c32-9381-5f9bd585e50d",
        "post_author": "user_84",
        "created_at": "2025-11-12T20:21:37.265116Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-01-02T13:19:17.575504Z",
        "post_text": "From today NASA announces Artemis III aiming to land first woman then non-divided space citizen anywhere beside moon December 2024 \ud83d\ude80\u2640 It opens doors even for SpaceX Mars Rovers ambitions on future planetary exploration.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f42a9a6e-a75a-48c6-8520-f0075eebfac7",
        "post_author": "user_71",
        "created_at": "2025-08-21T01:23:51.912654Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-31T22:07:30.098461Z",
        "post_text": "Space telescopes such as Hubble & James Webb are pivotal windows enabling humanity's understanding of galaxies cosmic, and celestial. Astronomers await more stunning new perspectives via their next release the #Cosmography ! \ud83d\udd08\ud83d\udc41\ud83c\udf0c J.D.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "0efacdb6-e7ee-4099-af74-47b689ec633f",
        "post_author": "user_18",
        "created_at": "2025-08-08T07:33:40.883360Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-24T12:43:23.511490Z",
        "post_text": "Zero-g workouts can now help maintain muscles mass aboard the ISS - vital given prolonged micro-g effect after space return \ud83d\udca7\ud83c\udf1f One study claims they minimize bone density drop among long distance crews.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "c4489097-98e3-42fd-b6c0-8ab3aabba6f8",
        "post_author": "user_96",
        "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:04:44.322353Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-11T04:36:36.806981Z",
        "post_text": "The Space Station, a bustling scientific city floating amidst star sky - humanity\u2019s newest construction site, orbits in orbital sync of #InternationalSpaceStation \u2619\u2705 Astronauts living and performing work in this orbit marvel makes us wonder at vast future horizons & infinite skies above \ud83e\ude90\ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udf0d",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "2fef4ffb-e1d3-44e8-b5b2-2b03dd25dbd5",
        "post_author": "user_78",
        "created_at": "2025-07-19T15:57:20.377466Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-05T22:28:16.339335Z",
        "post_text": "There will not long remain NASA crew only at the lunar station with commercial and private groups also venturing here with commercial missions launching soon as part or #MoonRacer14 saga.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "21d7061c-88d2-40bb-9132-ff25bcbbc885",
        "post_author": "user_88",
        "created_at": "2025-12-21T06:45:51.854942Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-08T03:20:19.905371Z",
        "post_text": "SpaceX's success has sparked both confidence and ambitions among smaller startups pushing into new technologies spaceships for destinations unknown.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "ae84eac4-4b13-4cc3-aa60-568a4d094992",
        "post_author": "user_63",
        "created_at": "2025-08-03T10:39:43.388881Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-31T06:18:47.265169Z",
        "post_text": "Every journey begins from that tiny spark & dreams bigger, deeper cosmic mysteries await us beyond known - space may not be an open invitation or even affordable \ud83d\udd89\ud83d\udce2 It is important to keep humanity pushing it however we are.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "47886663-562a-49bb-b502-55262c727c2f",
        "post_author": "user_7",
        "created_at": "2025-06-06T11:22:28.061457Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-10-05T09:21:49.147252Z",
        "post_text": "We have come far this past decades driven forward by a force wanting only bigger questions in front of our eyes: To expand who among humankind dare to brave, seek answers cosmic depths yet vast, cold void with only courage bravery on that adventure way \ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\ude80 Astrophysicists\u2019 next front is dark sector understanding, the cosmos 10% left unseen or unknown.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "64a6c196-d7fb-4525-8cf3-4a0625f562bc",
        "post_author": "user_36",
        "created_at": "2025-05-19T21:02:23.703831Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-02T12:47:42.585199Z",
        "post_text": "While space endeavors may dazzle - a darker tale under those stars include space radiation\u2019s dangers \ud83d\udd82\ud83c\udf0c. Exposing their crew for many missions it leads to genetic impacts beyond. How much risk each voyage in outer spaces carries? Who pays? The taxpayer's pocket must we count that as a trade-off?",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "e29324d6-e059-46d0-8127-9eeaea84852f",
        "post_author": "user_17",
        "created_at": "2025-12-22T07:57:11.050377Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-07T09:34:04.739943Z",
        "post_text": "Humans reach to beyond and yet always feel vulnerable like earth, it's home despite every outward journey, we can go only as far above while remaining firmly groundbound, it reminds about who is keeping us. Just here with the Earth - how many miles is too distant if ever? \u2604\ud83c\udf0c",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "2cd5dc78-4ef9-4ced-b716-95a2452c4cc2",
        "post_author": "user_95",
        "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:19:08.285912Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-01-16T08:29:12.184903Z",
        "post_text": "Moon landings of yore seemed distant then today seeing an actual first step set, for a new human milestone to hit the celestial body is finally upon us - though that next major jump beyond the moon has yet its place within human future horizons as we see a move near SpaceX with lunar return intentions.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Space Travel and Astronauts"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "099c402a-8f41-4500-b1b6-d8cbf530328f",
        "post_author": "user_72",
        "created_at": "2025-05-07T07:32:47.230780Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-31T05:58:33.955230Z",
        "post_text": "Human evolution & species survival could depend from space flight, whether Mars mission one day happens and how humans can thrive or survive once off this globe. What risks do crews undertake in our race and destiny quest? Our life span extended by tech's power on journeys beyond known \ud83c\udf1f\ud83d\udcab.Space exploration teaches us much more than we thought and about the real universe\u2019s vast unknown.",
        "likes": 0,
