        "created_at": "2026-01-02T05:10:44.813281Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-09T21:04:02.196688Z",
        "post_text": "Do Less To Understand That Fewer Designs Can Mean Greater Impact Within The Space \u2013 We Allowing Our Interiors Tell The Story Through Texture Layering, Painting With Color To Shape Emotionals, And Finding Simple, Purposeful Elements That Amplifies Feel Good Factor Instantaneously.",
        "likes": 0,
