        "created_at": "2026-03-22T11:51:50.952336Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-29T02:42:36.373135Z",
        "post_text": "As San Francisco's iconic foggy days keep rolling in with dramatic flair today isn't it magical?! \ud83c\udf03 \u2728 It's those moments wrapped beautifully between Golden Gate Tunnel whispers. \ud83d\udcbc \ud83d\udd1c Don\u2019t forget to \ud83d\udc4e BundleUp if a run out under these soft clouds takes you by night too, oh SF!\ud83c\udf09",
        "likes": 0,
