        "post_author": "user_80",
        "created_at": "2026-02-01T08:16:04.952460Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-04-06T16:32:06.915996Z",
        "post_text": "When chilly air brings Chilly mist to San Francisco mornings as gray curtains drawn from skies above we know its going to hit another \ud83c\udf17 \"fog forecast.\" There\u2019s more to explore in our fog-filled cities like KarlTheFog if one is curious to delve deeper than just Instagram likes.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
