        "post_author": "user_23",
        "created_at": "2026-03-21T12:03:21.969081Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-12T19:58:43.247650Z",
        "post_text": "\ud83c\udf0d We support the California High-Speed Rail initiative. Emilia and I believe it aims to bring positive change despite recent delay struggles \ud83d\udde8\ufe0f\ud83c\udf10",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "e1644d7d-5932-4483-92d7-c20cda46b3ef",
        "post_author": "user_95",
        "created_at": "2026-04-06T05:21:31.881633Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-02-13T08:33:21.081419Z",
        "post_text": "Funding worries: How are stakeholders keeping promises of fully covering its costs? As ridership ramps up, delays and high rates concern future travelers. \ud83d\udc6e \u26f4\ud83d\udeab\u8d9f\u8f66\u5ef6\u8fdf\u53ca\u9ad8\u7968\u4ef7\u5f15\u53d1\u5e7f\u6cdb\u5173\u6ce8",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "20980e8f-3756-44d8-aa16-4b6bf6bcc2ab",
        "post_author": "user_53",
        "created_at": "2026-02-20T14:25:47.880484Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-15T04:03:03.737817Z",
        "post_text": "Citizens expect the $96bn HSR project by 2031 & a bullet train speed exceeding 570.kmph in SF/TLa line for them. Let us stay tuned and encourage others, too.\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udd2c\ud83d\ude85",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "9759dd64-4d27-4ab2-9e0d-8626e4a13fed",
        "post_author": "user_32",
        "created_at": "2025-08-09T04:04:05.396795Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-02-15T04:15:03.059134Z",
        "post_text": "Public sentiment: While there\u2019s overwhelming support online pushing projects forward \ud83c\udf10#, progress hasn\u2019t mirrored our excitement yet, we should also anticipate and accommodate further infrastructure disruptions arising within this plan! \u2191\ufe0f\ud83c\udf10",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "650b508b-2651-45e4-bb45-1ffbe6168721",
        "post_author": "user_14",
        "created_at": "2025-09-20T09:54:56.302902Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-17T22:04:39.766444Z",
        "post_text": "We can travel faster over 804 miles without getting in any cars or airplanes but with more environmentally-concerning outcomes? Let's assess pros and cons then make a better informed statement of opinion!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "4e2c04c8-036c-4ef3-9437-c83e8afa0342",
        "post_author": "user_61",
        "created_at": "2025-07-23T23:22:10.255666Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-02-25T20:08:55.733265Z",
        "post_text": "FH is considering moving the southernmost phase under Fresno, an environmental justice issue \ud83d\udd89 \u2193",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
