        "post_author": "user_59",
        "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:51:28.612536Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-02-27T06:44:55.849543Z",
        "post_text": "In California high-speed rail: After years and years of hope and support from Californian residents like myself; what happened? Where is it at ? \u262f\ud83e\udd14\ud83d\ude84\uff1f",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "726b40e1-c767-48ab-906c-633149dd850d",
        "post_author": "user_30",
        "created_at": "2025-07-24T03:39:37.523953Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-30T16:44:26.990446Z",
        "post_text": "It seems to finally have green alternatives beyond HSR, including solar car transportation... but will that save time faster than building bullet lines ? Let\u2019s stay tuned. >>>\ud83d\ude80",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "cb9f0e12-6616-4f4e-8030-ea1783b85cdf",
        "post_author": "user_52",
        "created_at": "2025-08-31T14:25:29.432303Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-15T06:34:54.919215Z",
        "post_text": "Support for moving the next Southern corridor section of California Trans\u6e7e\u533a commuter Rail through Fresno! As it may be key in providing access & mobility options \ud83d\udc66\ud83c\udf10\u6e7e\u533a\u7684commuterrail\u51fa\u884c\u9700\u8981\u66f4\u597d\u7684\u516c\u4ea4\u8fde\u63a5,\u4eba\u4eec\u5bf9\u7eff\u8272\u672a\u6765\u5f88\u61a7\u61ac",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "c27e94ca-720c-40ad-afc9-966c1a6c9fd4",
        "post_author": "user_99",
        "created_at": "2025-08-13T15:59:06.309871Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-23T22:13:48.648137Z",
        "post_text": "FH rail could solve congestion issues without requiring extensive use to replace all flights \u2708\ufe0f\ud83c\udfe0\u89e3\u51b3\u4e86\u5835\u8f66\u5e76\u5927\u5e45\u51cf\u5c11\u4e86\u4f9d\u8d56\u98de\u673a\u7684\u6bd4\u4f8b\u3002",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "8ed91dad-507b-449d-9d1c-c8b9f53ffaa0",
        "post_author": "user_52",
        "created_at": "2026-01-06T19:25:43.920065Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-07T17:19:18.984418Z",
        "post_text": "FH needs serious federal backing which is where we\u2019re struggling and falling short so long. Let future Californiana\u2019s plan well.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "7a86300c-c5dc-4f96-afe6-cd9c9a9f141a",
        "post_author": "user_43",
        "created_at": "2026-04-11T14:34:02.996802Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-06-14T21:14:38.025918Z",
        "post_text": "The high demand for a modern transportation link across America is growing fast on account of recent announcements involving new modes as well \ud83e\uddf6\ud83c\udf0d",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "fae49060-3e9c-475c-9507-1d1367b36677",
        "post_author": "user_34",
        "created_at": "2025-07-07T23:06:15.190397Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-04-20T02:39:02.721454Z",
        "post_text": "I believe a new government funding mechanism is desperately needed in California not after more studies but faster towards implementation because the timeline & costs continue to be unclear... \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\u8dd1\u6b65\u7684\u5dde\u653f\u5e9c\u5b98\u5458\u548c\u9879\u76ee\u652f\u6301\u8005\u7684\u77db\u76fe\u662f\u76ee\u524d\u7684\u4e00\u5927\u70ed\u70b9\u4e4b\u4e00",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "California High Speed Rail"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "7a415f50-cacd-4960-a897-9dc9d11aad24",
        "post_author": "user_34",
        "created_at": "2025-05-17T17:59:30.577553Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-07T12:49:22.699163Z",
        "post_text": "In this Open Water training season I've learned about critical tide patterns like the infamous high surge through the Bay Bridge Tunnel. Leading an eagle-eyed swim team is my mission. \ud83c\udf0a\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffc #SwimLikeItMeasuless #",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "479406fb-9508-4a01-ab6f-3a76e60891dd",
        "post_author": "user_45",
        "created_at": "2026-01-24T16:54:48.634722Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-26T06:40:19.382445Z",
        "post_text": "Taking the Alcatraz swim now for me can be overwhelming amidst freezing cold! It forces self-improvement on so many planes but what a rush afterwards! \u2744\ufe0f\ud83c\udfaf",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "bc0fe5c6-1a7d-4d21-b76c-00463b3a0791",
        "post_author": "user_78",
        "created_at": "2026-04-28T00:45:53.346105Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-06-14T23:54:57.047215Z",
        "post_text": "The other month, our endurance race at sunrise in San Diego was more challenge that I had anticipated. Each dolphin sighting felt exhilarating even with chill from underwater! \ud83d\udcac \ud83c\udf03\ud83c\udf1f#AnimalFanzilla #TrihardersChat",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f35647e1-16f6-48c7-aba4-8afe35240bcf",
        "post_author": "user_74",
        "created_at": "2025-07-12T03:56:55.834819Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-05-19T23:41:05.329304Z",
        "post_text": "Winding through choppy waters of Channel and crossing halfway to Santa Monica never failed to get the best start ever when wearing those trusty open surf wetsuits!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "4c5f8c2e-dbf3-43bb-864e-1a4eab0cdfb3",
        "post_author": "user_56",
        "created_at": "2025-05-04T09:40:27.752057Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-04-06T14:53:50.021343Z",
        "post_text": "Navigated a rogue gale that nearly capsized during winter waves - reminder to double back our planning before tackling extreme open-water races.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "f6ecd311-c3ba-4693-b677-b4b128302b6e",
        "post_author": "user_69",
        "created_at": "2026-01-09T11:43:38.587291Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-04-11T23:33:49.367059Z",
        "post_text": "Enduring cold showers was an extra challenge through first dip this season swimming at 32-dec freezing - not knowing its severity made preparation harder, more exciting as one of challenges here. \u2692\ud83d\udca6\u51b7\u6c34\u9a6c\u62c9\u677e\u4e0d\u662f\u8bf4\u6e38\u7740\u73a9\uff0c\u662f\u771f\u7684\u8981\u6709\u8db3\u591f\u7684\u8010\u6027\uff1b\u7279\u522b\u662f\u51b7\u9177\u7684\u6d77\u6d0b\u73af\u5883\u4e2d!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "90b5d898-6c7e-48ae-8d77-e033b78a5110",
        "post_author": "user_95",
        "created_at": "2026-01-03T13:33:52.118031Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-13T17:26:19.936333Z",
        "post_text": "The tide doesn\u2019t care it hits many swimmers wrong that race conditions and navigation skills can quickly differentiate a finish ahead of pack to a washout.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "30a1db01-1fa2-4f80-bcc5-5c64c2cf5bb0",
        "post_author": "user_9",
        "created_at": "2026-04-15T02:59:57.391862Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-04-04T20:48:41.323970Z",
        "post_text": "Open water running the waves requires precise strategies against unpredictable rippers or even underwater reefs without visibility due to sudden rain!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "1d9f2bf9-4def-43bd-aec1-4e8e43f46941",
        "post_author": "user_80",
        "created_at": "2025-08-26T08:45:35.384866Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-03-09T07:28:21.456825Z",
        "post_text": "For those contemplating a cold-water challenge, prepare! I suggest donning not one but dual wetsuits under my normal - this has often paid huge dividends when racing. \ud83d\udee0\u51b7\u6c34\u8dd1\u6b65\u7684\u6ce2\u6d6a\u9700\u8981\u7cbe\u786e\u5730\u5236\u5b9a\u7b56\u7565\uff0c\u53bb\u5e94\u5bf9\u4e0d\u53ef\u9884\u6d4b\u7684\u5730\u6ed1\u6216\u66f4\u751a\u2014\u2014\u7279\u522b\u662f\u5728\u7f3a\u4e4f\u89c6\u529b\u4e0e\u6df1\u5ea6\u611f\u77e5\u7684\u60c5\u5883\u4e2d\u6ca1\u6709\u3002\u96f7\u66b4\u96e8\u5c31\u5c5e\u4e8e\u5178\u578b\u7684\u5f02\u5e38\u60c5\u51b5\uff01",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "ff3d361c-424a-4b44-b00f-c1e099ba99f0",
        "post_author": "user_93",
        "created_at": "2026-03-28T07:16:08.593967Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-11-04T21:15:06.889608Z",
        "post_text": "Openwater swimmers know that training in varying conditions is essential to improve our end races \u2013 be mindful, even more at cold currents or chilly dives to a rocky bottom while racing! Rocky Bottom, Cold Water.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "540b6565-8173-421f-b512-2f770fa5a4c3",
        "post_author": "user_86",
        "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:22:50.368598Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-09-27T15:53:10.208641Z",
        "post_text": "Evening dawn in Malo Bali sets beautiful yet the sea adds unpredictabilities. Always have your swimming timing ready for early sunrise open water swims that set up beautifully with tropical air temperature!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "78436a78-789f-42cb-a9a7-d5c4f64448a6",
        "post_author": "user_38",
        "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:30:43.498119Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-07-12T19:22:40.774964Z",
        "post_text": "Inland waters can get muddy and dirty faster without those fresh currents coming through but this offers perfect photo opps too - so many good angles are available in different conditions like mud, algae and undersea wildlife that populate much of these envir.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "d71fa172-3b70-4ac4-a93b-d30ce233384b",
        "post_author": "user_86",
        "created_at": "2026-04-12T00:26:40.322605Z",
        "modified_at": "2026-01-06T00:09:50.324584Z",
        "post_text": "Preparing to complete swimming a big Triathlon (aspiring it at any upcoming seasons) \u2013 will involve mastering cold open oceans not least because of huge benefits to all systems during swim distance training!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "4573805f-0364-473f-8021-49c092981847",
        "post_author": "user_23",
        "created_at": "2025-12-14T10:46:09.991937Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-21T15:10:46.846800Z",
        "post_text": "Climbing mountains doesn't prepare one as thoroughly against Open Sea in general but opening my doors today to my wetsuited friends coming and planning this race soon. \ud83c\udd57\ud83c\udf1e",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "e139a91a-d454-4f7a-b945-b1f4f95a1ba9",
        "post_author": "user_71",
        "created_at": "2026-03-04T02:17:28.541705Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-08-22T16:48:12.002665Z",
        "post_text": "Remember - when choosing a route you can follow through an open water swam season\u2019s progress by using our buoyarys (and many, who don\u2019t place it exactly how someone else plans which always comes as more unexpected than intended). Be flexible!",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
        "post_id": "6023734f-f3f7-4465-bc86-d31d672bc426",
        "post_author": "user_27",
        "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:40:44.300649Z",
        "modified_at": "2025-12-01T11:31:31.662364Z",
        "post_text": "You will want to dive in next time or never hear of this if ever a wetsuit didn't go perfectly under cold seas. But they're so very good at protecting during the storm of your run.",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
    {
