        "modified_at": "2025-10-12T00:54:15.429619Z",
        "post_text": "Never has been this evident when it really matters you choose to keep wearing that water-guard for long open, open-ended periods especially over an endless stretch under water as one dives and flips themselves! \ud83d\udca7",
        "likes": 0,
        "image_url": null,
        "generated_topic": "Open Water Swimming"
    },
